OL,3,GNEWSATour of Britain women's cycling
OL,4,Arace 2026: Clitheroe to Blackpool
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire is welcoming the Tour of
OL,7,FBritain women's cycling race for the
OL,8,Ffirst time.
OL,10,FStage two of the race will pass through
OL,11,Fmore than 70 miles (113km) of
OL,12,FLancashire later, starting in Clitheroe
OL,13,Fand finishing in Blackpool.
OL,15,FRiders will tackle Waddington Fell and
OL,16,Fthe Nick o' Pendle before passing
OL,17,Fthrough areas including Sabden,
OL,18,FWhalley, Hurst Green, Longridge,
OL,19,FBroughton, Weeton and Lytham, followed
OL,20,Fby a sprint to the finish line next to
OL,21,FBlackpool's Mirror Ball.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
